WEBVTT

00:00.014 --> 00:01.008
THIS IS A WORK OF FICTION UNDERAGE
DRINKING IS STRONGLY PROHIBITED.

00:01.008 --> 00:01.967
SCENES INVOLVING ALCOHOL
WITH FORCEFUL CONSUMPTION

00:01.967 --> 00:02.968
AND SHAMEFUL ACTS
ARE NOT ENCOURAGED.

00:02.968 --> 00:04.011
PLEASE VIEW THIS AS A COMEDY.

00:04.011 --> 00:05.012
FURTHERMORE, ALL CHARACTERS
APPEARINGIN THIS WORK ARE OF LEGAL AGE.

00:06.555 --> 00:07.348
Huh?

00:07.389 --> 00:10.434
WANNA GO TO THE MOVIE THEATER?

00:10.684 --> 00:13.437
Have you told Chisa and Kouhei?

00:15.189 --> 00:16.607
THAT'S NOT IT

00:16.607 --> 00:19.026
I MEANT JUST THE TWO OF US

00:24.240 --> 00:27.868
Let's ride out into the
highway of our youth

00:27.868 --> 00:31.014
Right now is always
the best of the season

00:31.080 --> 00:34.542
Get high on hope, as
we adults keep winning

00:34.625 --> 00:38.087
Let's take a dive to explore
an entirely new world

00:41.423 --> 00:43.509
Ever Endless

00:44.718 --> 00:46.387
Ever Endless

00:48.138 --> 00:49.682
Ever Endless

00:51.559 --> 00:52.935
Ever Endless

00:53.602 --> 00:58.399
Mon-Tues-Weds-Thurs-Fri,
my life knows no variety

00:58.399 --> 00:59.817
Ever Endless

01:00.234 --> 01:05.030
Sat-Sun, wake up in the afternoon
with only my smartphone to surf

01:05.030 --> 01:06.615
Ever Endless

01:06.615 --> 01:08.033
All my limbs' been giving in

01:08.033 --> 01:09.869
Kalbi's a burden
like my lumber spine

01:09.869 --> 01:11.453
Doing family
service with irises dim

01:11.453 --> 01:13.080
But you know that
I'll go all the way

01:13.497 --> 01:16.667
Glitter, shimmer,
the light's shining

01:16.959 --> 01:20.504
Let's give it one more chance

01:20.504 --> 01:23.966
Let's ride out into the
highway of our youth

01:24.175 --> 01:26.969
Right now is always
the best of the season

01:27.178 --> 01:30.806
Get high on hope, as
we adults keep winning

01:30.806 --> 01:33.809
Let's take a dive to explore
an entirely new world

01:34.059 --> 01:36.187
Youth is when you never...

01:36.187 --> 01:37.688
stop chasing your own values

01:37.688 --> 01:39.356
Our youth's eternal

01:39.356 --> 01:40.941
the color never fades with age

01:40.941 --> 01:42.818
Youth is when you keep...

01:42.818 --> 01:44.361
getting lost along the way

01:44.361 --> 01:47.907
Youth is Forever

02:01.045 --> 02:03.589
Ah! I sent it!

02:06.717 --> 02:09.011
This is not the time
to be embarrassed.

02:09.595 --> 02:11.055
I don't have...

02:11.305 --> 02:12.890
much time left.

02:16.268 --> 02:18.187
H-He already replied?

02:18.771 --> 02:21.315
SORRY IT'S SO LATE I'M
HERE TO RETURN THE BOOK

02:21.357 --> 02:23.567
Yahoo, Aina.

02:24.777 --> 02:28.280
Can you let me hate
you for a bit, Kikko?

02:28.280 --> 02:30.157
I don't get it, but no.

02:30.241 --> 02:32.076
Well whatever, here you go.

02:34.703 --> 02:37.331
Since I've got
them, good night...

02:37.331 --> 02:38.082
Hey Aina.

02:38.082 --> 02:41.168
Feels like there's
something fun going on here.

02:41.168 --> 02:43.337
No, no, there's nothing here!

02:43.504 --> 02:46.298
Then you wouldn't mind
if we stay like this, right?

02:46.507 --> 02:50.344
Maybe I'll stick
around for a while.

02:50.594 --> 02:52.555
This is just between us, okay?

02:52.555 --> 02:53.305
Uhm.

02:53.305 --> 02:54.098
The truth is...

02:54.098 --> 02:55.516
Ah, wait a sec.

02:55.516 --> 02:56.267
Huh?

02:57.560 --> 02:59.353
We came to hear your story.

02:59.353 --> 03:01.105
I heard it's just between us?

03:01.355 --> 03:03.315
Why did you call them over?

03:03.315 --> 03:05.943
The four of us share one heart.

03:06.235 --> 03:08.487
That reaction really hurts.

03:08.487 --> 03:09.238
Right...

03:09.238 --> 03:11.365
Do you not have faith in us?

03:11.365 --> 03:14.159
Your faces tell me you
want to mess with me.

03:15.077 --> 03:19.623
But I think it's best if you
get your opinions, you know?

03:20.291 --> 03:22.835
I'm serious about it being
between us, you hear?

03:22.835 --> 03:23.627
Yup.

03:23.878 --> 03:25.838
That's what happened.

03:26.213 --> 03:27.965
So bored...

03:27.965 --> 03:30.217
All you did was invite
him to the movies.

03:30.217 --> 03:32.636
Middle schoolers
are bolder than that.

03:32.887 --> 03:33.846
How could you!

03:33.846 --> 03:36.348
This is my college debut anyway.

03:36.348 --> 03:37.308
Sorry, sorry.

03:37.308 --> 03:39.059
Cheer up, okay?

03:39.059 --> 03:40.311
So what was his answer?

03:41.103 --> 03:42.855
That right! I
haven't seen it yet.

03:43.898 --> 03:46.901
IORI KITAHARA - AH, I GET IT KK,
THEN 2 PM IN FRONT OF THE STATION

03:49.528 --> 03:51.113
Good for you, Aina.

03:51.113 --> 03:52.198
Congrats.

03:52.198 --> 03:53.324
It's nothing.

03:53.657 --> 03:56.160
Which means your next
issue is your date plan.

03:56.160 --> 03:57.203
Y-Yeah.

03:57.203 --> 03:58.787
What should I do for the date?

03:59.038 --> 04:02.416
I've never asked anyone
out so I don't know.

04:02.750 --> 04:04.919
Why did you make me ask, then!?

04:05.419 --> 04:07.171
That reminds me.

04:07.171 --> 04:09.131
Keiko, you live
with a boy, right?

04:09.131 --> 04:10.299
Huh? Really?

04:11.634 --> 04:13.135
You could say that.

04:13.677 --> 04:15.679
Then give me some advice.

04:16.514 --> 04:18.807
Boys are simple.

04:18.807 --> 04:20.518
Oh, well said.

04:20.518 --> 04:21.810
Be more specific.

04:22.061 --> 04:24.188
Whenever he says something...

04:24.396 --> 04:26.857
just say "Is that so,"
"I didn't know that,"

04:26.857 --> 04:29.068
"That's amazing!"
and praise him.

04:29.068 --> 04:30.319
U-uh, huh.

04:32.071 --> 04:36.367
After that, just bury his face in
your chest, it's an easy one-hit K.O.

04:37.826 --> 04:40.996
It's that simple, huh?

04:41.080 --> 04:41.914
Yup.

04:42.289 --> 04:43.707
They're that simple.

04:44.208 --> 04:46.043
My six-year-old
brother, that is.

04:46.043 --> 04:49.338
I was an idiot
for believing you!

04:49.838 --> 04:52.716
Keiko, don't you live
with your parents?

04:52.716 --> 04:53.384
Yeah.

04:53.384 --> 04:55.177
Sorry, Aina.

04:55.177 --> 04:57.596
It was just a joke.

04:57.596 --> 04:58.347
Aina?

04:58.597 --> 05:01.225
His brain is at a
six-year-old's level anyway.

05:02.017 --> 05:03.227
It'll probably work.

05:03.727 --> 05:06.397
Seriously, is the
guy you fell for okay?

05:06.856 --> 05:07.898
There's no helping it.

05:08.357 --> 05:12.194
We'll at least help you
out picking your clothes.

05:12.278 --> 05:13.737
Huh? Really?

05:13.737 --> 05:17.867
Otherwise, you'll take forever to
choose and you'll end up being late, right?

05:17.867 --> 05:20.619
You really do have that habit.

05:20.619 --> 05:22.538
You need to show your legs!

05:22.538 --> 05:24.498
Take advantage of being skinny.

05:24.498 --> 05:26.959
- Come on, come on!
- Show a little cleavage.

05:26.959 --> 05:29.128
- How about something simpler?
- Eh!?

05:36.385 --> 05:38.387
I guess I'm a little early.

05:38.679 --> 05:39.346
Oh.

05:40.014 --> 05:41.557
You're already here?

05:42.057 --> 05:44.435
You're early yourself.

05:45.186 --> 05:48.647
It's been a while since I did anything
other than drinking or diving, after all.

05:49.064 --> 05:51.108
As you can see, I'm
looking forward to it.

05:54.320 --> 05:55.237
What's wrong?

05:55.529 --> 05:56.739
Nothing.

05:58.657 --> 06:00.576
Iori, do you like movies?

06:00.576 --> 06:02.161
I'm pretty into sports movies.

06:02.620 --> 06:04.955
We're watching
"Outbox" today, aren't we?

06:04.955 --> 06:05.706
Huh?

06:05.706 --> 06:08.042
Now that I think about
it, I was so hyped up...

06:08.042 --> 06:09.793
that I didn't think
of what we'd watch.

06:10.419 --> 06:11.587
Am I wrong?

06:11.587 --> 06:14.340
Nope, I wanted
to watch that too.

06:14.506 --> 06:16.759
But how did you
guess it was that movie?

06:16.759 --> 06:18.969
I could tell by
looking at that line up.

06:19.386 --> 06:20.137
Huh?

06:25.226 --> 06:26.310
MAGICAL GIRL LALAKO! THE
MOVIE FARMING CONCLUSION

06:26.310 --> 06:27.937
We wouldn't be able
to watch "Outbox"...

06:27.937 --> 06:30.022
IF CHISA WAS HERE
if we were with them.

06:30.022 --> 06:30.856
IF KOUHEI WAS HERE Lalako!

06:30.898 --> 06:33.734
So that's what he
meant by "Ah, I get it."

06:34.026 --> 06:35.194
Come one, let's go.

06:35.194 --> 06:37.071
Huh? Are we not buying tickets?

06:37.488 --> 06:39.698
I already got the
discounted couple's tickets.

06:39.907 --> 06:40.658
Couple?

06:41.867 --> 06:44.245
T-That's so smart of you.

06:44.245 --> 06:46.747
I don't think it's anything
worth praising for.

07:02.346 --> 07:04.557
That was so good!

07:04.557 --> 07:05.599
Right!?

07:05.808 --> 07:07.977
Boxing is so cool!

07:07.977 --> 07:09.645
It really gets you heated up!

07:09.645 --> 07:12.857
The scene where he pushes
the protagonist to not give up.

07:12.857 --> 07:15.818
Yeah! That was the best!

07:16.360 --> 07:18.696
YOU'RE NOT PLANNING ON GOING
STRAIGHT HOME AFTER THE MOVIE, RIGHT?

07:18.696 --> 07:21.407
DO YOUR BEST AND HANG
OUT SOMEPLACE NICE.

07:22.867 --> 07:23.951
That's right!

07:23.951 --> 07:26.829
I forgot they told me about
the best stores around here!

07:26.829 --> 07:28.664
Stores.. the stores...

07:28.831 --> 07:30.916
CURRENT TIME 16:00They're not open yet!

07:31.000 --> 07:35.004
Uh, well, uh! It's still
too early to eat and...

07:35.004 --> 07:36.380
- Ah, you're right.
- So...

07:37.590 --> 07:39.091
Well, there's
nothing you can do.

07:39.300 --> 07:40.885
How about coming with me?

07:40.885 --> 07:41.510
Huh?

07:42.011 --> 07:44.054
SPORTS SHOP

07:44.680 --> 07:47.516
Sorry about making you
come along while I shop.

07:47.766 --> 07:49.977
I don't mind. What're
you looking for?

07:49.977 --> 07:51.687
First of all, a swimsuit.

07:51.687 --> 07:53.898
I also want to look at
dive computer and fins.

07:53.981 --> 07:55.357
You sure have money.

07:57.026 --> 07:58.527
Yeah, I've been
working part time.

07:59.236 --> 08:00.738
How nice.

08:01.197 --> 08:02.406
Is he your boyfriend?

08:02.406 --> 08:05.117
Ah, no, that's not it.

08:05.117 --> 08:06.785
Oh, is that so?

08:07.494 --> 08:10.956
But you're close enough to
go shopping together, right?

08:10.956 --> 08:14.084
Huh? No, we're just...

08:14.084 --> 08:15.586
She's so innocent.

08:15.711 --> 08:18.881
Then it must be a nice
sight to see him in a swimsuit.

08:18.881 --> 08:19.465
Huh?

08:20.674 --> 08:22.927
But I see him fully
naked all the time.

08:22.927 --> 08:24.845
What is up with
this septic couple?!

08:25.846 --> 08:27.348
Cheers!

08:27.806 --> 08:29.558
You sure know some good shops.

08:29.558 --> 08:30.935
Y-Yeah.

08:32.478 --> 08:34.897
This place has
a great feel to it.

08:35.856 --> 08:37.691
Thanks, you three.

08:37.983 --> 08:39.527
Here's your chicken skewers.

08:40.694 --> 08:43.364
Now that I think of it,
these were in the movie, too.

08:43.364 --> 08:44.865
Yeah, during his diet.

08:45.449 --> 08:47.618
He ate them like they
were garbage though.

08:47.618 --> 08:50.829
Well, he did eat the same
thing almost every day.

08:51.747 --> 08:54.500
But he pushed
through it for his goal.

08:54.500 --> 08:56.210
Yeah, that really got me!

08:57.044 --> 09:00.881
People that focus on
one thing are so cool.

09:00.881 --> 09:03.217
They seem so nice and lively.

09:03.717 --> 09:07.888
If only I had something that I love
enough to focus everything I had on it.

09:07.888 --> 09:08.764
Huh?

09:09.348 --> 09:11.475
You got makeup, right?

09:11.475 --> 09:13.727
It isn't like that for me!

09:22.278 --> 09:23.654
This is fun.

09:23.654 --> 09:26.407
To watch the same thing
and share our opinions...

09:26.407 --> 09:27.950
is really fun.

09:27.950 --> 09:29.326
I love it.

09:29.326 --> 09:32.121
The movie... The diving...

09:36.208 --> 09:37.585
Ah luv ya...

09:39.587 --> 09:40.337
- Huh?
- Eh?

09:43.716 --> 09:45.134
Olive?

09:46.427 --> 09:49.763
Ah, uhm... That's not it.

09:50.014 --> 09:51.891
I wonder if they
put "Olive" into this.

09:52.224 --> 09:54.018
What are you talking about?

09:54.018 --> 09:55.811
Nobody put olive
into a drink shaker.

09:56.020 --> 09:57.646
Ah, I'd like another beer.

09:57.855 --> 10:00.274
Phew, that was close.

10:00.357 --> 10:02.651
That was a nice save,
if I do say so myself.

10:03.235 --> 10:06.238
With this, no one will
think it was a confession.

10:06.530 --> 10:07.907
She just confessed.

10:07.907 --> 10:09.200
Did she just confess?

10:09.200 --> 10:10.117
So cute.

10:10.367 --> 10:12.036
That guy should die!

10:13.537 --> 10:15.039
That was delicious.

10:15.039 --> 10:16.081
It was.

10:16.081 --> 10:17.291
Alrighty then.

10:17.291 --> 10:18.584
Yeah, let's go home.

10:19.001 --> 10:19.668
Huh?

10:20.127 --> 10:22.421
Since we're already
out, let's go a little longer.

10:22.421 --> 10:23.297
Huh?

10:23.964 --> 10:26.467
Cheers!

10:26.467 --> 10:28.469
Sigh, so this is what you meant.

10:28.469 --> 10:31.514
I already told you the
usual drinking was going on!

10:32.014 --> 10:33.349
Did you go somewhere?

10:33.349 --> 10:35.476
Yeah, we went to see a movie.

10:35.809 --> 10:36.894
Dive Blue?

10:36.894 --> 10:38.479
Nope, Outbox.

10:38.479 --> 10:39.897
I see.

10:40.481 --> 10:43.067
Chisa, your tastes are
well defined, aren't they?

10:43.067 --> 10:44.109
Is that so?

10:44.568 --> 10:46.195
So you're not aware of it.

10:46.445 --> 10:50.658
People that focus on
one thing are so cool.

10:55.955 --> 10:56.830
Huh?

10:57.206 --> 10:58.707
Is there something on my face?

10:58.707 --> 11:00.876
There are eyes and a
nose and a mouth on you.

11:01.168 --> 11:03.337
You have those too.

11:03.671 --> 11:05.214
Azusa-san, where are you going?

11:05.548 --> 11:07.508
I'm off to buy some more stuff.

11:08.050 --> 11:09.677
Then I'll come along too.

11:09.677 --> 11:10.678
Is that so?

11:12.847 --> 11:15.224
It's still a little
cold at night.

11:15.224 --> 11:16.600
Indeed.

11:17.476 --> 11:18.978
By the way, Iori.

11:18.978 --> 11:19.645
Yes?

11:20.396 --> 11:21.438
What're you going to do?

11:21.647 --> 11:23.524
Huh? About what?

11:23.524 --> 11:24.149
Huh?

11:24.316 --> 11:25.609
Nothing happened?

11:26.277 --> 11:27.611
What are you talking about?

11:28.070 --> 11:29.321
Hmm...

11:29.905 --> 11:32.241
Then I'll rephrase my question.

11:32.241 --> 11:32.992
Okay.

11:33.200 --> 11:35.911
Was Aina acting strange today?

11:38.998 --> 11:41.500
A little bit, now
that you mention it.

11:42.418 --> 11:43.586
I see.

11:43.586 --> 11:45.087
Did something happen?

11:45.087 --> 11:46.046
Hmm...

11:48.090 --> 11:50.676
I guess I should let you know.

11:50.801 --> 11:51.677
What is it?

11:53.012 --> 11:54.096
You see, Aina...

11:54.805 --> 11:57.600
had some family matters come
up and she's going back home.

11:59.101 --> 12:00.019
Huh?

12:01.687 --> 12:03.689
Cakey's going home?

12:03.689 --> 12:04.481
Yup.

12:04.773 --> 12:07.526
It's about Aina's
school expenses.

12:08.194 --> 12:10.988
The "family
circumstances" thing.

12:11.488 --> 12:14.408
Cakey's family circumstances?

12:15.868 --> 12:18.329
Honey, we got a
letter from Aina.

12:18.329 --> 12:19.830
Oh, is that so?

12:20.039 --> 12:23.417
Let's see what kind of life
our beloved daughter is living.

12:23.417 --> 12:24.376
I'M DOING FINE

12:24.501 --> 12:26.587
Dear, pull her
out of university.

12:26.587 --> 12:27.588
Yes, immediately.

12:29.924 --> 12:32.051
Of course they would
after seeing her like that.

12:32.635 --> 12:36.096
I just said it was
about expenses, right?

12:37.097 --> 12:39.517
So it's about money, right?

12:39.767 --> 12:41.101
Seems like it.

12:41.435 --> 12:43.270
That's how it is.

12:43.938 --> 12:48.025
Just keep in mind that
her time here is short.

12:51.820 --> 12:53.489
So Cakey is heading back home.

12:53.739 --> 12:55.658
What should I do?

12:55.991 --> 12:58.035
Well, if it's about finances...

12:58.160 --> 13:00.538
she can apply for a scholarship.

13:01.205 --> 13:03.874
I guess it comes to that.

13:03.874 --> 13:05.167
Is there a problem?

13:05.167 --> 13:07.044
I've looked into it, too.

13:07.294 --> 13:11.090
The condition is that her high
school GPA must be above 3.5.

13:11.090 --> 13:13.759
A GPA above 3.5?

13:14.510 --> 13:15.845
What about her PE?

13:15.845 --> 13:17.304
Probably a 1.

13:17.596 --> 13:19.098
Home EC? Arts?

13:19.098 --> 13:20.724
At most a 2.

13:21.517 --> 13:22.518
So that means...

13:22.852 --> 13:26.146
for everything else, she
would need at least a 3.9.

13:26.814 --> 13:29.900
Hmm, she needs to
get them all above 4...

13:30.776 --> 13:32.778
Heh? Basically impossible.

13:34.697 --> 13:37.658
Well, let's try to find
out in a roundabout way.

13:37.658 --> 13:39.326
Why not ask her directly?

13:39.451 --> 13:42.037
She might be trying
to keep this a secret.

13:42.454 --> 13:43.747
I see.

13:45.291 --> 13:47.418
- That's right.
- Hey Cakey.

13:48.085 --> 13:50.004
How've you been
doing in class lately?

13:50.004 --> 13:51.547
Are you keeping up?

13:51.547 --> 13:52.965
Why do you care now?

13:53.048 --> 13:55.926
Just a little worried
about your grades.

13:55.926 --> 13:58.220
Are you keeping
up with your studies?

13:58.596 --> 14:01.765
Like I'd ever tell you guys!

14:02.016 --> 14:03.225
It's no good.

14:03.225 --> 14:05.019
She's so wary of us.

14:05.311 --> 14:07.897
If she can't get a scholarship,
then maybe a part time job.

14:07.897 --> 14:08.856
Hmm...

14:08.856 --> 14:11.400
But she seems clumsy.

14:12.026 --> 14:12.818
That's true.

14:13.152 --> 14:16.447
If only there was a job that
paid well despite being clumsy.

14:17.198 --> 14:18.115
Ah!

14:18.407 --> 14:20.367
I know the perfect
job, Kitahara!

14:20.367 --> 14:21.076
Oh?

14:21.076 --> 14:24.246
A place that would forgive
clumsiness and pay well.

14:24.496 --> 14:26.540
Is there really such
a great part-time job?

14:27.541 --> 14:31.212
At a maid cafe, being clumsy
is just one of the qualities.

14:31.212 --> 14:32.588
S-SORRY, BIG BROTHER...
AH! MASTER I see.

14:34.840 --> 14:35.966
Hey, Cakey.

14:35.966 --> 14:36.884
What is it?

14:37.510 --> 14:38.719
How should I put this...

14:38.719 --> 14:39.386
Well...

14:39.762 --> 14:41.222
You got enough spending money?

14:41.222 --> 14:43.349
A couple of dads from
an awkward family!?

14:43.474 --> 14:45.601
Are you onto something again?

14:45.601 --> 14:47.520
Absolutely not!

14:47.520 --> 14:48.938
Your eyes are darting around.

14:48.938 --> 14:51.148
Haha! We would never.

14:51.440 --> 14:53.859
This is bad, she's
even more cautious.

14:53.859 --> 14:55.528
Let's retreat and try again.

14:56.487 --> 14:59.365
Mentioning a part-time
job will give it right away.

14:59.657 --> 15:02.201
If we can give her this dress...

15:02.201 --> 15:05.037
she'll naturally get the idea
of working at a maid cafe.

15:07.957 --> 15:08.916
What is it?

15:09.208 --> 15:11.835
I just happen to have
something for Chisa.

15:12.545 --> 15:14.755
If I give this to Chisa,

15:14.755 --> 15:16.465
I can give something
to Cakey too.

15:16.465 --> 15:18.259
I see, it'll be totally natural.

15:18.467 --> 15:19.218
Chisa.

15:19.426 --> 15:20.761
What is it this time?

15:20.886 --> 15:21.679
Here.

15:21.887 --> 15:22.388
Huh?

15:22.388 --> 15:23.806
Oh, a present?

15:24.098 --> 15:25.558
Mmm, thanks.

15:25.558 --> 15:26.559
That's nice.

15:26.559 --> 15:27.977
I got one for you too, Cakey.

15:27.977 --> 15:28.727
Huh?

15:29.687 --> 15:31.397
Thanks, Iori.

15:31.605 --> 15:32.523
Don't mention it.

15:32.523 --> 15:34.692
It's thanks for always
helping me out.

15:38.946 --> 15:40.281
What the hell is this?

15:41.115 --> 15:43.450
THEY WANT TO SEE YOU TRYING IT ONAh right, I read about this in a magazine.

15:44.869 --> 15:49.164
Does this mean Iori wants
to see me wearing this?

15:54.211 --> 15:54.837
Huh?

15:57.047 --> 15:58.299
You pervert!

15:58.299 --> 16:00.634
Hold on! Let me explain!

16:01.844 --> 16:02.553
~EXPLAINING THE SITUATION~

16:02.553 --> 16:03.637
~EXPLAINING THE
SITUATION~ A starfish.

16:04.138 --> 16:05.556
Do you understand now?

16:05.556 --> 16:07.808
I understand Aina's story.

16:07.808 --> 16:09.810
But why did you give me panties?

16:11.061 --> 16:12.897
Because of my promise.

16:13.564 --> 16:14.899
Thank you, Chisa.

16:14.899 --> 16:18.152
As thanks, I'll get you
some seductive underwear.

16:19.361 --> 16:21.322
When did I say I wanted them?

16:21.655 --> 16:23.657
If you don't need it,
you can sell it online.

16:23.657 --> 16:25.826
USED WOMEN'S UNDERWEAR
That'd definitely cause confusion.

16:26.827 --> 16:28.704
I see, so there's that option.

16:28.704 --> 16:30.039
Huh? What option?

16:30.039 --> 16:31.957
Are you going to
sell something online?

16:31.957 --> 16:32.875
Yeah.

16:32.875 --> 16:35.294
We have Kaya
Mizuki's wetsuit, right?

16:35.628 --> 16:37.546
Let's sell it for 2 million yen.

16:37.546 --> 16:39.256
Scumbag!

16:42.426 --> 16:44.845
Understood, I'm looking
for a buyer right now.

16:44.970 --> 16:45.596
Huh?

16:46.096 --> 16:48.015
No way! Is it
already up for sale?

16:48.015 --> 16:50.518
KIDNEY FOR SALE - 2 MILLION YEN
I'M A HEALTHY COLLEGE STUDENT

16:50.726 --> 16:52.895
No matter how much,
I still won't sell it.

16:52.895 --> 16:53.896
Why not!?

16:54.188 --> 16:55.481
I'm begging you!

16:55.481 --> 16:56.607
No means no.

16:56.607 --> 16:58.651
But I want it so bad!

16:58.651 --> 17:00.236
I'm hiding Kaya-san's wetsuit.

17:00.236 --> 17:02.404
Please, Kotegawa-sama!

17:03.531 --> 17:05.407
Raise your head, Kouhei.

17:08.285 --> 17:10.996
Kitahara, is
that... It can't be!

17:12.498 --> 17:14.625
I beat Chisa to
it and secured it.

17:14.959 --> 17:16.126
Is this okay?

17:16.877 --> 17:18.796
It is what it is.

17:18.921 --> 17:20.047
It couldn't be helped.

17:20.506 --> 17:23.175
Wasn't my old wetsuit here?

17:23.259 --> 17:25.719
I just saw Iori take it.

17:26.095 --> 17:29.598
I'm sorry, Iori, you committed
such a crime for me.

17:29.598 --> 17:32.977
Yeah, honestly, the
guilt is crushing me.

17:33.310 --> 17:36.647
Just wait! I'll sell my kidney
right now and get the money!

17:36.647 --> 17:39.316
Stop! I'd feel
worse if you did that!

17:39.316 --> 17:41.068
Then what should I do?

17:41.068 --> 17:42.069
Let's see.

17:42.319 --> 17:45.155
You should have some
treasure hidden, right?

17:45.155 --> 17:46.031
Huh?

17:47.449 --> 17:50.077
Why am I also going
to Imamura's house?

17:50.286 --> 17:52.037
It's my first time too.

17:52.496 --> 17:55.374
If something bad comes up,
I need someone to report it.

17:55.708 --> 17:57.126
Can't rule that out.

17:58.878 --> 18:00.421
Give me a second to tidy up.

18:00.754 --> 18:02.590
Don't worry about
it being messy.

18:02.756 --> 18:04.049
That's not it.

18:04.550 --> 18:08.095
There are things I
don't want others to see.

18:09.221 --> 18:11.056
What don't you
want others to see?

18:13.017 --> 18:14.101
Huh? What's wrong?

18:14.310 --> 18:15.060
It's nothing.

18:15.186 --> 18:17.438
Is he being considerate?

18:17.438 --> 18:18.230
Huh?

18:20.441 --> 18:21.567
Come in.

18:21.817 --> 18:23.027
Finally.

18:23.027 --> 18:24.069
It's so hot.

18:25.905 --> 18:26.906
Sorry to intrude.

18:26.906 --> 18:29.575
Honestly, we're done waiting.

18:32.119 --> 18:34.371
What the hell did you clean?!

18:34.371 --> 18:35.080
Ugh!

18:35.456 --> 18:38.167
Did we really have to
wait in the heat for this?

18:38.876 --> 18:42.546
No way! This is really
after it's been cleaned.

18:43.756 --> 18:44.757
Huh?

18:44.757 --> 18:45.591
What is it?

18:45.591 --> 18:47.635
LALAKO-TAN: AN IN-DEPTH ANALYSIS
So many copies of the same book.

18:47.635 --> 18:51.597
Probably for preservation
or for polythesizing.

18:51.680 --> 18:54.975
Even so, that's a bit too many.

18:54.975 --> 18:57.144
This is basically
like a missionary.

18:57.228 --> 18:58.938
You saw them.

19:00.439 --> 19:03.108
How long have you
been preaching this?

19:03.108 --> 19:04.068
Preaching?

19:04.235 --> 19:05.277
Am I wrong?

19:05.528 --> 19:07.905
No, converting the masses
was always the point.

19:08.239 --> 19:11.867
But I drew these
back in high school.

19:13.452 --> 19:15.204
LALAKO-TAN: AN IN-DEPTH
ANALYSIS You drew this?

19:15.204 --> 19:15.955
CIRCLE NOW VILLAGE
No way, it's good.

19:15.955 --> 19:16.914
Really?

19:17.331 --> 19:18.999
Honestly.

19:19.166 --> 19:22.836
So even Kotegawa
knows I'm an otaku now.

19:22.836 --> 19:23.128
Huh?

19:23.128 --> 19:24.755
Just ignore him.

19:25.214 --> 19:27.299
Forget that, we need
to find things of value.

19:27.299 --> 19:30.010
Yeah, find anything
that looks like it'll sell big.

19:30.010 --> 19:31.887
You guys sound like
a couple of thieves.

19:32.137 --> 19:33.597
- How about this?
- An erotic novel.

19:33.597 --> 19:35.307
- This?
- Erotic Doujinshi.

19:35.307 --> 19:36.934
- Then what about this?
- An erotic game.

19:36.934 --> 19:38.769
All this shit is erotic!

19:40.688 --> 19:43.899
In the end, we couldn't
find anything worth selling.

19:44.108 --> 19:46.485
I guess I'll just have
to sell my kidney.

19:46.777 --> 19:49.321
My bad, but that's
the old man's wetsuit.

19:51.657 --> 19:55.160
I can try selling
some of my stuff, but...

19:55.160 --> 19:57.955
Even combining with my
things, it won't be nearly enough.

19:58.247 --> 19:59.790
Then what do we do?

19:59.790 --> 20:00.749
Let's see.

20:01.041 --> 20:04.211
If we can't make money,
we can save money instead.

20:04.211 --> 20:04.920
Meaning?

20:05.129 --> 20:08.716
The largest expense is rent.

20:12.219 --> 20:12.887
Cakey.

20:12.887 --> 20:13.888
What is it?

20:13.888 --> 20:15.097
Come here for a second.

20:15.848 --> 20:17.766
I heard about it from Azusa-san.

20:17.766 --> 20:18.475
Huh?

20:18.851 --> 20:21.437
You're going home due to
family circumstances, right?

20:23.939 --> 20:24.857
Yeah.

20:24.857 --> 20:26.108
What do you want to do?

20:26.901 --> 20:28.986
I don't want to go back.

20:28.986 --> 20:29.570
I see.

20:30.404 --> 20:31.989
Then why don't you stay here?

20:34.158 --> 20:34.867
But...

20:34.867 --> 20:36.869
Life might be a little tough.

20:36.869 --> 20:39.079
But I'll do my best
to support you.

20:39.079 --> 20:41.081
Iori... do you mean...

20:41.081 --> 20:43.042
I don't know how
useful it will be,

20:43.209 --> 20:45.628
but I've tried to provide
everything you might need.

20:57.431 --> 20:58.557
Hey, Cakey.

20:58.849 --> 21:00.226
If you don't mind,

21:01.602 --> 21:02.937
why don't you live here?

21:03.187 --> 21:05.481
What kind of
punishment is this!?

21:08.317 --> 21:09.735
Hmm...

21:09.735 --> 21:10.986
Why did she refuse?

21:10.986 --> 21:13.155
We provided everything.

21:13.280 --> 21:14.448
Hey you guys.

21:14.448 --> 21:16.116
Gather around for a sec.

21:16.116 --> 21:16.951
Okay.

21:17.785 --> 21:19.286
So as I was saying.

21:19.828 --> 21:23.415
Aina is going back home
to help out with the farm.

21:24.124 --> 21:24.917
Oh.

21:25.209 --> 21:26.627
The farm?

21:28.337 --> 21:31.048
I won't get to make
any summer memories.

21:31.048 --> 21:32.424
Azusa-san!

21:32.591 --> 21:35.469
You said it was for
financial reasons!

21:36.095 --> 21:39.098
If she doesn't go help, she won't
get her school expenses paid.

21:39.098 --> 21:40.891
Stop making everyone panic!

21:41.267 --> 21:42.852
We worried for nothing.

21:42.852 --> 21:45.855
That's right, I want
all my stuff back!

21:48.315 --> 21:50.025
Sorry for making you guys worry.

21:53.279 --> 21:55.072
Huh? The hell you say?!

21:55.072 --> 21:57.241
You cakey demon!

21:57.241 --> 21:59.201
Huh? Even without my makeup?

21:59.410 --> 22:02.246
But it's true I'll be
gone for a while.

22:02.830 --> 22:07.126
Don't go making memories
while I'm gone, okay?

22:07.334 --> 22:09.211
- As if!
- As if!

22:21.682 --> 22:23.225
Wanna talk to you,
wanna talk to you

22:23.225 --> 22:25.102
First I gotta know all
about you, isn't that right?

22:25.102 --> 22:27.062
Ending it off at round
one reeks of boredom

22:27.062 --> 22:28.814
Rounds two, three,
and four is the plan

22:28.814 --> 22:30.524
As the night gets deeper,
true thoughts escape

22:30.524 --> 22:32.443
Let us go on and on
and dive down late

22:32.443 --> 22:35.446
Your history, your scenery, for
me will your pages get slippery

22:35.446 --> 22:37.489
Hey, show me even more

22:37.489 --> 22:39.241
This is my track and
you are the featured guest

22:39.241 --> 22:40.826
We'll forget by the
time when the dawn hits

22:40.826 --> 22:42.286
Being incomplete is perfection

22:42.286 --> 22:44.538
Hey, show me even more

22:44.538 --> 22:46.123
My mouth keeps slipping,
my mouth keeps slipping

22:46.123 --> 22:47.750
Complaint whether
we sober upward

22:47.750 --> 22:49.793
For now, let's ride
high on this feeling

22:50.169 --> 22:56.217
Let's live this moment with all we
can without leaving a single regret,

22:56.717 --> 22:58.427
We are gonna do it,
we go past the limit now

22:58.427 --> 23:00.054
Not just the whole night,
party till the sun is out

23:00.054 --> 23:02.223
Let's fly high

23:02.223 --> 23:02.806
(Let's fly high)

23:02.806 --> 23:04.808
So first, you just strip it down

23:04.808 --> 23:07.102
An exposed and
feral kind of bond

23:07.102 --> 23:10.731
It's the way of life's cycle,
let us go way beyond

23:10.731 --> 23:12.358
The very moment that
we met I drop my shy act

23:12.358 --> 23:14.109
I wanna bare it all and
say what I need to say

23:14.109 --> 23:16.111
Do it now...

23:16.904 --> 23:21.200
This is the magic spell that breaks
down each and every single wall

23:21.200 --> 23:24.662
And once you get used to
it, you won't feel a thing at all

23:24.662 --> 23:26.163
Being without clothes
is a mystery I live in

23:26.163 --> 23:27.915
The drinking and chatting
is flowing more freely

23:27.915 --> 23:30.292
Try it now...

23:30.709 --> 23:34.213
And right before you
realize what's going on

23:34.213 --> 23:38.425
Your heart will catch
right up and finally be free

23:44.932 --> 23:49.937
NEXT TIME LET'S GO TO
THE UNINHABITED ISLAND!
